    "font" : "CMR9",
    "font size" : 8.966,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where A and l represent the wave amplitude and wavelength in the classical sense, h0 represents the undisturbed water depth, and S represents the Stokes number. The ﬁrst - order form of the abcd−system is"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 23,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 168.359, 226.83, 338.795, 256.823 ],
    "font" : "CMMI9",
    "font size" : 8.966,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "∂tη + ∂xw + ∂x(wη) + a∂x3w − b∂x2∂tη = 0, ∂tw + ∂xη + w∂xw + c∂x3η − d∂x2∂tw = 0."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 24,
    "level" : "1",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 416.879, 240.139, 428.617, 249.105 ],
