    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 25,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 81.599, 190.819, 428.692, 221.745 ],
    "font" : "CMR9",
    "font size" : 8.966,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Here, η is proportional to the deviation of the free - surface position at x; w = w(x, t) is proportional to the horizontal velocity at the point (x,z0, t) at the depth z0 in the ﬂow domain. The constants a, b, c, d are not arbitrary, and they satisfy the relationships"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 26,
    "page number" : 1,
