    "font" : "CMR9",
    "font size" : 8.966,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "a = 12 θ2 − 31 λ, b = 21 θ2 − 13 (1 − λ), c = 12(1 − θ2)µ, d = 12(1 − θ2)(1 − µ),"
